  "details": "Description\n\nIt sounds like everyone's mic activation threshold is set too high. It seems like my latency is high, people are speaking back to me slower than tbey normally do. this is the first time it's happened. my network connections are fine. started when i logged in and opened an instance for my event. happened with the first person who joined and all others since so not due to crowded instance.\n\nReproduction Steps\n\nlog in, i guess? i logged off, restarted headset, logged back in and it's still happening. idk how i triggered it\n\nDetails\n\n- Category: Audio\n\n- Frequency: Once\n\n---\n\nplatform: PC (platform: Windows, store: Steam, headset: None)\n\nrawPlatform: WindowsPlayer\n\nclientVersion: 2026.4.1p3-1939-4803d92ede-Release\n\nunityVersion: 6000.0.67f1-DWR\n\nIn-Client Report\n\n---\n\n**Log file:** [output_log_2026-11-19_19-04-52.txt](https://api.vrchat.cloud/api/1/file/file_5b3a10c0-5857-4a88-8785-fe72ca9dca6a/1/file)",
